<title>USA: Medical Imaging Centers sets vote date.</title>
<headline>Medical Imaging Centers sets vote date.</headline>
<dateline>SAN DIEGO 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Medical Imaging Centers of America Inc said Thursday it set a date of September 20 as the record date to be a shareholder voting on the company's proposed merger with U.S. Diagnostic Labs Inc.</p>
<p>The vote will be held November 6. The company said it will send a notice of the meeting and proxy statements to its shareholders on or about September 23.</p>
<p>On August 1, the company signed a definitive merger agreement to be acquired for $11.75 per share in cash by U.S. Diagnostic Labs.</p>
<p>--New York Newsdesk  (212) 859-1610</p>
